 (there and then, or later on if you want to)",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":76,"isNumbered":65,"icon":80,"image":81},[77],{"type":33,"text":78,"spans":79},"Enter the details of the person you're sending it to",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":83,"description":84,"showPaddingTop":20},"You can now add a video message to your parcel with Evri video","With Evri video you can make your parcel even more personal by adding a video message. All you need to do is follow these 3 simple steps:","list_block$705a681b-11bd-4064-a81a-8ecf95a850f5","list_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":88,"primary":90,"id":107,"slice_type":108,"slice_label":29},[89],{},{"CardImage":91,"CardAvatar":100,"CardTitle":101,"CardText":102,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":106,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":92,"alt":95,"copyright":29,"url":96,"id":97,"edit":98},{"width":93,"height":94},1000,667,"A mother and her two children record an Evri video on their mobile device. They are sat cuddled up on a sofa in their living room.","evri-video.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tkFpbqstJ9-fA3_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7325.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tkFpbqstJ9-fA3",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":99},"transparent","none","How does the recipient know they have a video to watch?",[103],{"type":33,"text":104,"spans":105},"When you record your video and send your parcel, we'll e-mail the recipient to let them know that your parcel is on its way to them with your personal video message. We'll also let them know how they can watch their video.",[],{"link_type":42},"card$88b9766d-744c-4b57-a73e-4a03b04aeff7","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":110,"primary":132,"id":134,"slice_type":86,"slice_label":29},[111,118,125],{"title":29,"content":112,"isNumbered":65,"icon":116,"image":117},[113],{"type":33,"text":114,"spans":115},"Download our app",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":119,"isNumbered":65,"icon":123,"image":124},[120],{"type":33,"text":121,"spans":122},"Scan your parcel's label",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":126,"isNumbered":65,"icon":130,"image":131},[127],{"type":33,"text":128,"spans":129},"Enjoy!",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":133,"description":29,"showPaddingTop":20},"Watch your video in 3 simple steps","list_block$2fbf37af-1146-4be8-baba-4d8343d275fd",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":136,"primary":137,"id":161,"slice_type":162,"slice_label":29},[],{"Image":138},{"dimensions":139,"alt":142,"copyright":29,"url":143,"id":144,"edit":145,"tablet":147,"mobile":154},{"width":140,"height":141},1200,280,"Over the shoulder view of a man watching an Evri video on his mobile phone. The video is of a mother and two children waving and smiling.","evri-video.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tklJbqstJ9-fBb_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7413.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2406%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6tklJbqstJ9-fBb",{"x":51,"y":146,"zoom":52,"background":99},2406,{"dimensions":148,"alt":142,"copyright":29,"url":151,"id":144,"edit":152},{"width":149,"height":150},704,240,"evri-video.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tklJbqstJ9-fBb_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7413.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2329%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":51,"y":153,"zoom":52,"background":99},2329,{"dimensions":155,"alt":142,"copyright":29,"url":158,"id":144,"edit":159},{"width":156,"height":157},343,160,"evri-video.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tklJbqstJ9-fBb_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7413.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1643%2C8192%2C3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":51,"y":160,"zoom":52,"background":99},1643,"photo_block$5330a6c0-cbf5-42e9-b7fa-83f090c3304b","photo_block",{"variation":164,"version":25,"items":165,"primary":211,"id":216,"slice_type":217,"slice_label":29},"default",[166,172,178],{"rowTitle":167,"rowBody":168,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"What if I no longer want to use the Evri video message?",[169],{"type":33,"text":170,"spans":171},"If you haven’t sent your parcel yet, just cancel and rebook your order without the Evri video option – we’ll send you a full refund. Log in to your account to cancel the order.",[],{"rowTitle":173,"rowBody":174,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"The barcode is damaged so I can’t scan it to play my message. What do I do?",[175],{"type":33,"text":176,"spans":177},"If your barcode isn’t scanning with the camera, enter the 16 digit number underneath instead.",[],{"rowTitle":179,"rowBody":180,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"My Evri video message won’t play?",[181],{"type":33,"text":182,"spans":183},"Firstly, make sure you’re using the Evri app (it’s available on Apple and Android devices) to view the video. You can also view your message on our website’s tracking page; just enter your tracking number. If you’ve scanned the label but your video message isn’t playing, just make sure that there’s one linked to the parcel you’re scanning. You’ll know that a video message is linked as you’ll see the message ‘I’ve got a video message’ on the tracking page within the app or our website. If you’re having issues with your video message, you’ll see an error message on screen.  If you reload the app then your video message should play or you can try viewing the video online by entering your tracking code into our tracking page.",[184,188,200,203,206,209],{"start":185,"end":186,"type":187},32,44,"strong",{"start":185,"end":186,"type":189,"data":190},"hyperlink",{"id":191,"type":192,"tags":193,"lang":15,"slug":195,"first_publication_date":196,"last_publication_date":197,"uid":198,"url":199,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YhZXZxIAACgA0Yuo","content-page",[194],"Our Services","download-the-evri-app","2022-02-23T16:01:29+0000","2026-04-28T12:20:10+0000","mobile-app","\u002Four-services\u002Fmobile-app",{"start":201,"end":202,"type":187},158,171,{"start":201,"end":202,"type":189,"data":204},{"link_type":38,"url":205},"evri-video.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":207,"end":208,"type":187},717,730,{"start":207,"end":208,"type":189,"data":210},{"link_type":38,"u